      "node_id": "kg_doc_19",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Jeremy Saxon Oxley (born 1961 in Kingscliff, New South Wales) is an Australian songwriter, singer and guitarist. He fronted the 1980s pop-rock band Sunnyboys.",
